{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samplingDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SamplingDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L391","fileName":"Tracker.swift"},"symbolKind":"property","title":"samplingDropReports","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV19samplingDropReports11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVyAA08SamplingD6ReportVGvp"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker’s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler"},{"type":"text","text":"s dropped, in the order the drops happen."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samplingDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV","text":"SamplingDropReport","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SamplingDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker samples each record after its enrichers and before the consent, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped record is never held, written to a store or delivered. Records a store recovered","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"aren’t sampled again.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a drop joins the waiting report of the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the reports waiting unread are at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"most one per event type, however many events are dropped. Copies of a tracker share one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence, which ends once the tracker has finished and every report has been read. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" tracker’s is empty."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/samplingDropReports":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingDropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"SamplingDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker’s "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s dropped, in the order the drops happen."}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports","title":"samplingDropReports","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"},"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Elements in the order they are enqueued, kept until they are read; one reader at a time reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncQueue"}],"title":"AsyncQueue","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncQueue"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","text":"Tracker","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV7RecordsV","text":"Records","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a delivery to read."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"records","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Sampler"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/SamplingDropReport":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/samplingdropreport","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Events a tracker’s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler"},{"type":"text","text":"s left out: the event’s name, how many were left out and when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they were tracked."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SamplingDropReport"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SamplingDropReport"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SamplingDropReport","title":"SamplingDropReport"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Tracker","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/noOp":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/noop","abstract":[{"text":"A tracker that drops every event, logging each one at debug level. Its ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"empty.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"noOp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"noOp"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tracker","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/trackers","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker app code tracks events with, and what it applies to each event before it is delivered: enrichers, samplers and consent."}],"type":"topic","title":"Trackers"}}}